abstract: >-
  Scripts, data and results that verify every statement of the article
  "Euler's thirty-six officers need not all be entangled: real AME(4,6),
  families and classification": a real AME(4,6) state with 60 non-zero
  coefficients and 12 classical officers, two closed-form 60-term families
  of AME(4,6) states, and the certified classification of their real points
  into 20 classes under local unitaries and party permutations.
